# Security Rules

- Role-based access for admin (service advisor, technician, manager/owner).
- Never expose internal notes, non-customer photos, or other customers’ data.
- Auth routes (`/login`, `/signup`, etc.) must be noindex and hardened.
- Use secure, httpOnly, sameSite cookies for sessions.
- No secrets in client code or committed files.
- Rate-limit authentication and public form submissions.
- Payment flows use hosted elements / Payment Element only.
